Guitar UI Experience:

A front-end project showcasing interactive guitar-related UI components, including accordions, tabs, rotators, and scroll-based navigation. This project is a work in progress and will expand as new components are added.

Current Features:
- Banner image
- Nav bar with links to future sections
- Interactive accordion sections (Benefits, Accessories)
- Custom diamond icons with active state toggling
- Smooth scroll behavior with scroll-margin offset
- Fretboard-inspired UI styling

- Acoustic Guitar Tabs Component(New Section):
    * A reusable, self contained tab section representing six common acoustic guitar body styles.  This section contains the HTML, CSS and   Javascript needed to render and control the tab interface.

        - HTML: markup for tab buttons and panels
        - CSS: spacing, colors, images, active tab states, hover effects
        - Javascript: reusable tab component logic
            * Querying tab buttons and tab panels
            * Managing active states
            * Ensures only one tab open at a time
        This component is designed to present acoustic guitar body types in a clean and interactive layout.  It will also serve as a reusable component that can be used for a future electric guitar tab section.

- Electric Guitar Tabs Component(New Section)
    * New tabbed section mirroring the acoustic tab section layout, covering six common electric body styles.
        - Reused the same component used for the Acoustic Guitar Tabs Component
        - Height adjustments planned for the polishing phase

- Tab Component Overview
    * The tab system is built with lightweight JavaScript and semantic HTML.
        Features include:

            - Click‑based tab activation
            - Shared styling across acoustic and electric sections
            - Smooth content transitions
            - Easy extensibility for future guitar categories

- Guitarist Slider(New Section):
    * Added a slider featuring 12 well known guitarists that showcases each guitarists signature guitar, playing style and musical attributes.
       - Added full HTML structure for the slider.
       - Implemented a reusable JS slider component to handle slide movement and track behavior.
       - Style the slider and track using patterns from a previous slider component.
       - Verified core functionality: manual sliding, track movement and layout responsiveness
       - Upcoming enhancements:
           - Auto-slide rotation
           - Pause on image and prev/next button hover
           - Additional Navigation controls if needed

- Soundhole Rotator Component(New Section):
       - Added a guitar-themed rotator styled around an acoustic guitar soundhole layout.
       - Includes rotating quotes/phrases with author styling.
       - Added string-pin dots that rotate in conjunction with the rotating quotes.
       - Includes pause and restart functionality with mouseenter and mouseleave.

- Scroll Logic(New):
       - Implemented scroll-based section activation for smoother navigation.
       - Highlights active sections as user scrolls.

Current Project Status:
* All major components(accordion, tabs, slider, rotator and scroll logic) are implemented.  Project is entering the final polish phase.  This phase will include refining the layout, spacing, responsiveness and visual consistency.


Tech Stack
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

Running the Project
Open index.html in a browser or use a local server (Live Server, etc.)

Work in Progress
More sections and UI components will be added as development continues.

